Let $\mathbf{v} = \begin{pmatrix} -2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}.$  Let $\mathbf{r}$ be the reflection of $\mathbf{v}$ over the vector $\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix},$ and let $\mathbf{p}$ be the projection of $\mathbf{v}$ onto $\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}.$

Note that $\mathbf{p}$ is the midpoint of $\mathbf{v}$ and $\mathbf{r}.$  Thus, we can use $\mathbf{p}$ to find $\mathbf{r}.$

[asy]
usepackage("amsmath");

